# Scores are obtained from https://gfxbench.com/result.jsp
# Select T-Rex test, find the GPU in the righthand side. Select Group by GPU.

# Note: 
  # Many -mali- GPUs have different versions, they are maked with an -mp#- ending.
  # Each version of the GPU has its own benchmark score (see malit880mp4 vs malit880mp2), but in most cases the GPU name is reported by the system without the -mp#- ending.
  # As a result in most cases the score of the version with no -mp#- will be used for all versions.
  # The only known exceptions from the above are mali400 which is also reported as an mp2 and mali450 which is also reported as an mp4.


